!!id:"https://tson.io/test-suite/class2/link/invalid/a-choice-variant-that-is-an-alias-of-an-extern-of-a-choice-not-disjoint-expected.tn"
!!import:"https://tson.io/test-suite/schemas/link-sidecar.tn"
{
  spec: "[TSON-SCHEMA] §5.4, [TSON-SCHEMA] §5.13, [TSON-SCHEMA] §8.3"
  description: """
    The hops to a variant's entry are followed whatever their order: `mine` is an alias of the extern `held_x`,
    whose target `held` is, in extern-choices.tn, an alias of `either`, a choice of two records that is not
    disjoint. `( text | mine )` is therefore a choice holding a choice not disjoint, a resolver error at the
    declaration.
    """
  error: {
    category: resolver
  }
}
